 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "Three lines of chips at width 360, Kotlin, Compose and Canvas filled (selected); the twelfth chip, Accessibility, wraps to a fourth line below the fold and scrolls into view. Resized: at 540 wide the chips fill two lines; at 240 wide they need more lines than than 140 dp holds, so the root scrolls vertically (verticalScroll) instead of overflowing.",
